From a188372bf28069896b4cfe5506accbd5e8008a4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: curbol <curtis.bollinger@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 20 Jun 2026 23:01:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] add missing <cstdint> and <iomanip> includes for GCC 16

GCC 16 dropped some transitive standard-library includes, breaking
files that relied on them implicitly.

The compiler diagnostics already pointed at the fix; this just
applies it.

- <cstdint> for uint*_t in:
    src/core/installer.cpp
    src/core/progressnode.{h,cpp}
    src/ui/applicationmanager.cpp
- <iomanip> for std::put_time in:
    src/core/versionchangelog.cpp
    src/ui/modlistmodel.cpp
    src/ui/nexusmoddialog.cpp

Verified by building cleanly to completion with GCC 16.1.1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/core/installer.cpp        | 1 +
 src/core/progressnode.cpp     | 1 +
 src/core/progressnode.h       | 1 +
 src/core/versionchangelog.cpp | 1 +
 src/ui/applicationmanager.cpp | 1 +
 src/ui/modlistmodel.cpp       | 1 +
 src/ui/nexusmoddialog.cpp     | 1 +
 7 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/core/installer.cpp b/src/core/installer.cpp
index 5662845..94e796d 100644
--- a/src/core/installer.cpp
+++ b/src/core/installer.cpp
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 #include "pathutils.h"
 #include <archive.h>
 #include <archive_entry.h>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <filesystem>
 #include <ranges>
 #include <regex>
